  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of Sustainability for Tunisian e-Government Service through Innovation of CNI s ITSM Capability</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By benchmarking Korea&apos;s best practices, transfer an integrated operations management system, including standardized IT management procedures tailored to Tunisia&apos;s National Information Center, and establish a roadmap to enhance the sustainability of Tunisia&apos;s e-government services</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the qualitative improvement of Tuinisia&apos;s e-government services by establishing an integrated operations management system for National Information Center of Tunisia&#xd280;&#xb2c8;&#xc9c0; &#xc804;&#xc790;&#xc815;&#xbd80;&#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xc9c8;&#xc801; &#xc81c;&#xace0;&#xb97c; &#xc704;&#xd55c; &#xad6d;&#xac00;&#xc815;&#xbcf4;&#xc13c;&#xd130;(CNI) IT&#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xd1b5;&#xd569;&#xc6b4;&#xc601;&#xad00;&#xb9ac;&#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xad6c;&#xcd95;&#xc804;&#xb7b5; &#xbc0f; &#xc774;&#xd589;&#xbc29;&#xc548; &#xc218;&#xb9bd;</narrative>
